# {{:program_name}}

DelphiMVCFramework {{:ai_dmvc_version}} project, generated by the DMVCFramework IDE wizard.

- `{{:program_name}}.dproj` builds the executable into `bin\`, next to `bin\.env` (configuration and secrets: never commit real values).
- Build from the command line: `rsvars.bat`, then `msbuild {{:program_name}}.dproj /p:Config=Debug /p:Platform=Win32`.

